== Trivia ==
* This item refers to a condition called [[wikipedia:harlequin-type ichthyosis|Harlequin Ichthyosis]], which is a rare skin condition from birth, which on babies gives puffy red eyes, green or red crackled/scaly skin, and stretched out lips.

